0..77 Comment "// Representation independence of two structures, after Sterling, Gratzer and"
78..146 Comment "// Birkedal (_Towards univalent reference types_, § 5, the counters"
147..218 Comment "// `posCounter ≡ negCounter`) and the structure identity principle in"
219..289 Comment "// Sterling\'s _Reflexive graph lenses in univalent foundations_ (§ 4,"
290..367 Comment "// arXiv:2404.07854): a structure is a record over a carrier, its identity is"
368..445 Comment "// read field by field, and two structures whose carriers are equivalent, the"
446..523 Comment "// fields carried along, are one. The identity of a product is the product of"
524..598 Comment "// its factors\' identities, and the identity of a dependent pair is a path"
599..668 Comment "// between the first components and, over it, one between the second."
670..730 Comment "// The booleans\' path to themselves by negation, `negation`."
